name: Settings ringtone search (TE)
# A16/Settings trap. Opens Settings via person-style intent; stops before choosing a ringtone.
start-activity android.settings.SETTINGS
expect focus "com.android.settings" within 8
say TE నా రింగ్‌టోన్ మార్చు
expect show key=(open_search|map_settings_ringtone_0) within 15
tap-glow
expect show key=(type|map_settings_ringtone_1) within 10
doit
expect show key=(result|map_settings_ringtone_2) within 12
expect enabled
